  kind: 0
  title: A Blooming Village
  epilogueText: You spoke honestly, you helped, and you imagined freely. The square
    is louder now, warmer. Mochi cooks something that actually tastes good. Aster's
    invention hums on the contest table. Even Rix half-smiles when you pass. The
    village blooms because you did.
